2042
01:13:59,370 --> 01:14:00,370
Welcome.

2043
01:14:00,371 --> 01:14:02,579
I love you as much as the space. Welcome to Space Rice Cake.

2044
01:14:02,580 --> 01:14:03,639
Hello.

2045
01:14:03,640 --> 01:14:06,080
Where are you going, Kyung Soo? Take the orders.

2046
01:14:06,780 --> 01:14:07,780
We took a half day off for this.

2047
