You don't usually get the receipt, but you got it...

2052
01:14:19,960 --> 01:14:21,430
- because it was from him. - You're right.

2053
01:14:22,160 --> 01:14:23,630
Before you go, let us do this.

2054
01:14:23,900 --> 01:14:25,169
I love you as much as the space. Welcome to Space Rice Cake.

2055
01:14:25,170 --> 01:14:26,200
Two, three.

2056
01:14:26,300 --> 01:14:29,270
I love you as much as the space. Welcome to Space Rice Cake.

2057
01:14:29,440 --> 01:14:30,870
- Please enjoy. - You can go upstairs now.

2058
01:14:31,640 --> 01:14:32,710
They ordered one of each.

2059
01:14:33,310 --> 01:14:34,680
- Call them out for us. - Okay.

2060
01:14:35,840 --> 01:14:37,539
A cake, a pizza,

2061
01:14:37,540 --> 01:14:40,480
a taco, a shrimp burger, and a beef burger.

2062
01:14:42,350 --> 01:14:44,249
- Answer me. - Okay.

2063
01:14:44,250 --> 01:14:46,050
- Seriously. - He's scary.

2064
01:14:46,390 --> 01:14:47,689
- You have to respond. - You have to make a cake.

2065
01:14:47,690 --> 01:14:48,790
Okay.

2066
01:14:49,590 --> 01:14:50,990
It's 130°C. It's turned off.

2067
01:14:51,760 --> 01:14:52,960
Why is this so arrogant?

2068
01:14:53,260 --> 01:14:54,859
- I told you. - I hate it.

2069
01:14:54,860 --> 01:14:56,799
Who's been cocky? Who is it?

2070
01:14:56,800 --> 01:14:58,229
- The fryer is so cocky. - This one.

2071
01:14:58,230 --> 01:15:00,330
Hey, fryer. You.

2072
01:15:00,730 --> 01:15:03,399
- "Hey, fryer." - Please teach it a lesson.

2073
01:15:03,400 --> 01:15:05,809
Why do you keep acting cocky? Why do you keep turning off?

2074
01:15:05,810 --> 01:15:06,940
Are you a safety device or what?

2075
01:15:07,840 --> 01:15:08,880
Hey, fryer.

2076
01:15:09,410 --> 01:15:10,480
I think it's for safety.

2077
01:15:10,980 --> 01:15:11,980
In that case, thank you.

2078
01:15:12,310 --> 01:15:13,609
(Basic kitchen safety: the fryer turns off...)

2079
01:15:13,610 --> 01:15:14,920
(after reaching the set temperature to prevent overheating.)

2080
01:15:15,820 --> 01:15:16,820
Are you trying to be funny?

2081
01:15:16,821 --> 01:15:18,049
