2086
01:15:25,490 --> 01:15:28,159
For some reason, a drama comes to mind...

2087
01:15:28,160 --> 01:15:29,330
because I'm working with Kyung Soo.

2088
01:15:29,630 --> 01:15:31,869
A drama with a situationship while working part-time.

2089
01:15:31,870 --> 01:15:32,870
You know what I'm saying. Right, Kyung Soo?

2090
01:15:33,630 --> 01:15:35,799
- Kyung Soo, today... - Please stir it for me.

2091
01:15:35,800 --> 01:15:36,870
Gosh. Seriously.

2092
01:15:37,270 --> 01:15:38,740
