I'm sorry, but we don't have aprons available.

2104
01:16:02,600 --> 01:16:05,299
- Would you like mine? - No. Thank you anyway.

2105
01:16:05,300 --> 01:16:07,030
- Would you like my apron? - No, it's okay.

2106
01:16:07,130 --> 01:16:08,569
- Ma'am? - Thank you.

2107
01:16:08,570 --> 01:16:11,570
I don't know if we have aprons for customers.

2108
01:16:12,170 --> 01:16:13,240
Let me give this first.

2109
01:16:13,770 --> 01:16:17,280
(She grabs aprons for employees in the pantry.)

2110
01:16:17,680 --> 01:16:18,710
Ma'am?

2111
01:16:19,010 --> 01:16:20,510
- How about this? - My gosh.

2112
01:16:21,380 --> 01:16:22,880
Actually,

2113
01:16:23,980 --> 01:16:25,789
this was worn by Head Chef Lee Young Ji...

2114
01:16:25,790 --> 01:16:27,789
when she was making...

2115
01:16:27,790 --> 01:16:30,690
original tteokbokki with all her soul.

2116
01:16:31,020 --> 01:16:33,189
- Is that 1? - Do you need 4?

2117
01:16:33,190 --> 01:16:35,429
- No, it's okay. - Only I need it.

2118
01:16:35,430 --> 01:16:36,459
Please wait.

2119
01:16:36,460 --> 01:16:37,659
- No. - It's really okay.

2120
01:16:37,660 --> 01:16:39,700
- Please wait. - We really don't need it.

2121
01:16:40,270 --> 01:16:42,969
(New customers arrive on the 1st floor.)

2122
01:16:42,970 --> 01:16:45,610
- Welcome. Hello. - My goodness.

2123
01:16:46,210 --> 01:16:47,440
My goodness.

2124
01:16:47,610 --> 01:16:48,710
(Laughing)

2125
01:16:48,880 --> 01:16:50,140
I'm getting a little jealous.

2126
01:16:50,240 --> 01:16:51,380
Let me go and see.

2127
01:16:51,980 --> 01:16:54,049
- Hello. - Hello.

2128
01:16:54,050 --> 01:16:55,350
No one is exclaiming.

2129
01:16:55,650 --> 01:16:56,749
I'm getting jealous.

2130
01:16:56,750 --> 01:16:58,050
(Server 1, pushed aside by the customers)

2131
01:16:58,820 --> 01:17:00,990
Who looks good with cool colours?

2132
01:17:01,220 --> 01:17:02,359
(Gasping)

2133
01:17:02,360 --> 01:17:03,719
- Do you look good with cool colours? - I'm sorry.

2134
01:17:03,720 --> 01:17:05,829
Sure. Thank you.

2135
01:17:05,830 --> 01:17:06,990
Let me see.

2136
01:17:07,230 --> 01:17:11,199
We even make sure that...

2137
01:17:11,200 --> 01:17:13,999
- Your service is amazing. - even your outfits stay spotless.

2138
01:17:14,000 --> 01:17:15,069
Thank you.

2139
01:17:15,070 --> 01:17:16,599
"I love you as much as the space." Two, three.

2140
01:17:16,600 --> 01:17:18,409
I love you as much as the space.

2141
01:17:18,410 --> 01:17:19,710
Thank you, everyone.

2142
01:17:20,970 --> 01:17:22,679
- Who asked for the apron? - Hey.

2143
01:17:22,680 --> 01:17:24,909
- I'm really sorry about that. - Goodness.

2144
01:17:24,910 --> 01:17:26,450
(We hope that they work it out amicably.)

2145
01:17:26,880 --> 01:17:28,380
This is unbelievable.

2146
01:17:29,050 --> 01:17:31,589
Ye Seul, I figured this out.

2147
01:17:31,590 --> 01:17:32,689
(With her mind at ease, the rice cake buns look beautiful.)

2148
01:17:32,690 --> 01:17:34,390
I have nothing much to do right now.

2149
01:17:34,760 --> 01:17:36,689
(It's very relaxing in the kitchen.)

2150
01:17:36,690 --> 01:17:37,760
I have nothing to do.

2151
01:17:38,690 --> 01:17:40,060
(However...)

2152
01:17:43,100 --> 01:17:45,770
(Were you looking for hardship?)

2153
01:17:45,900 --> 01:17:46,929
- Mi Hyun. - Yes?

2154
01:17:46,930 --> 01:17:48,339
What do I do? It turned very dark.

2155
