It won't stick if you put it vertically.

2163
01:18:04,250 --> 01:18:05,549
(Pay attention to me too.)

2164
01:18:05,550 --> 01:18:08,359
It's okay. What should we do about this?

2165
01:18:08,360 --> 01:18:09,390
Should I cut it...

2166
01:18:09,820 --> 01:18:11,020
- instead? - Instead?

2167
01:18:11,260 --> 01:18:12,759
To save part of it.

2168
01:18:12,760 --> 01:18:13,860
Shall we do that?

2169
