2191
01:19:14,550 --> 01:19:15,559
What's wrong with you?

2192
01:19:15,560 --> 01:19:16,760
(You're too slow.)

2193
01:19:16,960 --> 01:19:19,689
(Is the head chef's position in danger?)

2194
01:19:19,690 --> 01:19:21,599
(And so begins)

2195
01:19:21,600 --> 01:19:23,760
