2196
01:19:24,060 --> 01:19:26,400
(A competition of who grills the dough fastest)

2197
01:19:26,700 --> 01:19:29,200
(A battle for the pride of the master chefs)

2198
01:19:29,440 --> 01:19:31,400
(This isn't dough.)

2199
01:19:33,440 --> 01:19:34,910
(This isn't dough.)

2200
01:19:35,140 --> 01:19:38,380
(Even the members turn away in disappointment.)

2201
01:19:38,780 --> 01:19:40,650
(Should I just do it?)

2202
01:19:40,880 --> 01:19:43,380
(Upset)

2203
01:19:43,950 --> 01:19:48,960
(Will the head chef be able to protect her status?)

2204
01:19:56,800 --> 01:19:58,400
(Space Rice Cake)
